#: templates/core/about.html:20
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(SITE_NAME)s is a website where donors register their blood type and area, and where families "
"can see how many compatible donors are ready in their city. It does not store or supply blood. "
"Hospitals and blood banks always make the final decision about who may donate."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:21
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(SITE_NAME)s is a student project, built for the course CSC-206 Software Engineering at Aror "
"University of Art, Architecture, Design and Heritage, Sukkur."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:24
msgid "A donor is shown as ready, and matched to a request, only when all of these are true:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:27
msgid "Compatible blood"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:27
msgid ""
